gpu-switcher (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix: the helper no longer crashes (NameError) when its rate-limit cleanup removes expired per-caller entries.
  * The helper's reply messages are now composed from shared building blocks; the wording is unchanged in every shipped language.
  * ruff (lint and format) and mypy (type check) are wired into the local checks (make lint, make typecheck); public contracts are type-annotated.
  * Test suite: snake_case method names, language-agnostic (English primary), and a catalog-completeness guard (no empty or fuzzy translations in any shipped locale).

